    "factsheet": [
        {
            "heading": "Creative Quests: Croydon Curiosity Rover",
            "paragraphs": [
                "Over the summer, this Curiosity Rover travelled across Croydon town centre, inviting residents to view familiar places from new perspectives. Part art studio, part community hub and part roaming spacecraft, take part in a series of creative missions exploring noticing, movement, nature and imagination. \nNow, at the end of it’s Croydon deployment, discover the stories, artworks and observations gathered along the way. Visitors can also take on their own missions, continuing the Rover’s journey of exploration and, most importantly, curiosity."
            ]
        },
        {
            "heading": "Build / Play / Shape Croydon",
            "paragraphs": [
                "This activity is part of Build / Play / Shape Croydon. Launch into a weekend of design-inspired creativity and play for all ages, 12-13 September. Find out more here: www.culturecroydon.com"
            ]
        }
    ],
